格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"dsh-companion turns DeepSeek Harness into a focused AI companion experience, with persistent relationship state and continuity across sessions","id":"gh:1351310598","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-companion","slug":"LamplitIsles/dsh-companion","topics":["companion-ai","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"dsh-companion turns DeepSeek Harness into a focused AI companion experience, with persistent relatio"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"nship state and continuity across sessions"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-companion"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"`@lamplitisles/dsh-companion` is a small, one-to-one Svelte surface for DeepSeek Harness (DSH). It k"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"eeps DSH's durable Workspace/Session contracts and adds a calm chat presentation at `/companion/`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The package is published from the `LamplitIsles/dsh-companion` repository as a\npublic npm package. I"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ts optional voice integration is provided by the separately\ninstalled Kepos Speech plugin."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install and build"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"This repository uses Bun:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"The publishable package contains the Host bundle, the browser bundle, the Cordis patch, declarations"},{"id":"p8s2","text":", and this README. To install a local build into a disposable or real DSH profile, pack it and use D"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"SH's plugin manager:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"The package is pinned to the published DSH `0.1.2-rc.1` contract family (Cordis `4.0.2`). It is inte"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ntionally not a compatibility layer for other DSH releases. Session-derived behavior reads the rc.1 "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"snapshot API; older eager event-array contracts are not supported."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Two surfaces"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- `/` remains the stock DSH Web UI, including advanced navigation, ordinary Tool views, Kepos ImageG"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"en's React view, and plugin settings.\n- `/companion/` selects the lower-priority Companion root. It "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"shows one configured Workspace and one remembered/recent Session, human and assistant chat, allowlis"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ted ImageGen images, and finalized Kepos Speech voice messages. A small **高级 DSH** link returns to `"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"/` with a full-page navigation so the two compositions do not leak into one another."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Typing `/compact` as the complete Companion input invokes DSH's Session command channel and keeps th"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"e continuity checkpoint invisible; other slash-prefixed text remains an ordinary message."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Messages sent during a reply use DSH's durable FIFO queue and remain separate turns. With an empty d"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"raft, the composer action stops the current reply without clearing queued messages; DSH resumes thos"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"e messages in order after cancellation settles."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The ordinary-send optimistic echo, request/RPC identity model, Session-to-Chat handoff, failure rest"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"oration, image ownership, and regression strategy are documented in Optimistic message sending and v"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"nership, and regression strategy are documented in Optimistic message sending and visual continuity."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"DSH continues to stream and persist model output internally, while Companion shows assistant text on"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ly after its message is finalized. The typing bubble gains a slowly rotating, non-repeating companio"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"n note after a 12-second wait; stopping or completing the reply clears that transient timer state."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"While ImageGen is running, its image skeleton and “正在画一张图…” status replace the generic typing bubble"},{"id":"p17s2","text":". If the agent resumes text generation after the image settles, the typing indicator returns with a "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"fresh long-wait timer."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The Companion deliberately does not include a Workspace picker, session list/new-chat flow, model or"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" preset controls, permissions/approvals, reasoning, Trajectory, generic Tool cards, prompt-injection"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" inspection, generic file upload, notifications, or multi-contact UI. It supports image messages thr"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ough DSH's Session attachment contract and one short voice-input control in the composer."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Configuration and recovery"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Open the native DSH plugin settings page on `/` and configure:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- one stable Workspace id;\n- Companion and user display names;\n- an optional bounded local avatar fo"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"r each identity (PNG/JPEG/WebP/GIF, at most 5 MB, decoded dimensions at most 4096 px);\n- the user's "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"preferred form of address; and\n- the default affinity for a new or explicitly reset relationship (in"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"m of address; and\n- the default affinity for a new or explicitly reset relationship (integer 0–100)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The configured Workspace is resolved by id and the live Session cwd. A missing id, stale Session, fa"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"iled open, send rejection, or lost connection is shown as a recovery state; the Companion never sile"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ntly selects another Workspace. The settings card keeps staged edits after a rejected/conflicted wri"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"te and provides native Discard/Save actions. Editing the default affinity does not rewrite an establ"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ive Discard/Save actions. Editing the default affinity does not rewrite an established relationship."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Mood, affinity, and signature are Host-owned state stored as append-only records under the configure"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"d Workspace at `.dsh/dsh-companion/state.jsonl`. Each successful change adds one timestamped complet"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"e state; the newest record drives the UI and Agent context, while earlier notes and per-field reason"},{"id":"p23s4","text":"s remain available as relationship history. Session logs are not the runtime state authority. Tests "},{"id":"p23s5","text":"use only test-owned state and never mutate a live Workspace. The Host validates and bounds every loa"},{"id":"p23s6","text":"d and mutation. The Companion exposes only a read-only relationship RPC to the browser; the agent's "},{"id":"p23s7","text":"`companion_update_relationship` Tool atomically changes mood, affinity, or both, while `companion_se"},{"id":"p23s8","text":"t_signature` independently changes its durable signature. `companion_read_history` deliberately vali"},{"id":"p23s9","text":"dates the full bounded JSONL and returns 1–20 recent records newest first without mutation; history "},{"id":"p23s10","text":"is never injected automatically into every turn. All three Tools remain hidden from the chat timelin"},{"id":"p23s11","text":"e. Cross-field and numeric bounds are enforced by Host TypeScript rather than advanced provider-faci"},{"id":"p23s12","text":"ng JSON Schema. Affinity movement is clamped to ±10 net per accepted turn, and the dynamic prompt co"},{"id":"p23s13","text":" Schema. Affinity movement is clamped to ±10 net per accepted turn, and the dynamic prompt co [长行截断]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Media dependencies"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Images use the selected DSH Session attachment contract. Only assistant structured image blocks and "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"successful/running/failed `kepos_image_generate` results are projected; unrelated Tool output is hid"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"den. Object URLs are page-owned and revoked when replaced or unloaded. The stock `/` ImageGen render"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"er remains untouched."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Voice rows recognize exactly one finalized `[[tts:text]]...[[/tts:text]]` passage (fenced code and m"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"alformed/multiple passages are ignored; normalized text is limited to 240 Unicode code points). Synt"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"hesis calls the already-installed Kepos Speech `synthesize` RPC on `/kepos-speech` with the live Ses"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"sion id. The returned audio URL must remain on the same-origin `/kepos-speech/audio/` route. A page-"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"local cache shares preparation by Session and normalized text, requires user activation for playback"},{"id":"p27s6","text":", and always leaves a transcript fallback. Install Kepos Speech alongside Companion when voice outpu"},{"id":"p27s7","text":"t or input is needed."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

